{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"Blessed is|strong=\"H6588\"he|strong=\"H1732\"whose disobedience is|strong=\"H6588\"forgiven|strong=\"H5375\",  \nwhose sin|strong=\"H2401\"is|strong=\"H6588\"covered|strong=\"H3680\".   \n"},{"number":2,"text":"Blessed is|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3068\"man|strong=\"H7423\"to|strong=\"H3068\"whom the|strong=\"H3068\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"doesn’t impute|strong=\"H2803\"iniquity|strong=\"H5771\",  \nin|strong=\"H3068\"whose spirit|strong=\"H7307\"there|strong=\"H3068\"is|strong=\"H3068\"no|strong=\"H3808\"deceit|strong=\"H7423\".   \n"},{"number":3,"text":"When|strong=\"H3588\"I|strong=\"H3588\"kept|strong=\"H2790\"silence|strong=\"H2790\", my|strong=\"H3605\"bones|strong=\"H6106\"wasted|strong=\"H1086\"away|strong=\"H3605\"through|strong=\"H3605\"my|strong=\"H3605\"groaning|strong=\"H7581\"all|strong=\"H3605\"day|strong=\"H3117\"long|strong=\"H3117\".   \n"},{"number":4,"text":"For|strong=\"H3588\"day|strong=\"H3119\"and|strong=\"H3027\"night|strong=\"H3915\"your|strong=\"H5921\"hand|strong=\"H3027\"was|strong=\"H3027\"heavy|strong=\"H3513\"on|strong=\"H5921\"me|strong=\"H5921\".  \nMy|strong=\"H5921\"strength|strong=\"H3027\"was|strong=\"H3027\"sapped in|strong=\"H5921\"the|strong=\"H5921\"heat|strong=\"H2725\"of|strong=\"H3027\"summer|strong=\"H7019\". \\+w Selah|strong=\"H5542\"\\+w*."},{"number":5,"text":"I|strong=\"H5921\"acknowledged|strong=\"H3045\"my|strong=\"H3068\"sin|strong=\"H2403\"to|strong=\"H3068\"you|strong=\"H5921\".  \nI|strong=\"H5921\"didn’t hide|strong=\"H3680\"my|strong=\"H3068\"iniquity|strong=\"H5771\".  \nI|strong=\"H5921\"said, I|strong=\"H5921\"will|strong=\"H3068\"confess|strong=\"H3034\"my|strong=\"H3068\"transgressions|strong=\"H6588\"to|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H5921\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\",  \nand|strong=\"H3068\"you|strong=\"H5921\"forgave|strong=\"H5375\"the|strong=\"H5921\"iniquity|strong=\"H5771\"of|strong=\"H3068\"my|strong=\"H3068\"sin|strong=\"H2403\". \\+w Selah|strong=\"H5542\"\\+w*."},{"number":6,"text":"For|strong=\"H5921\"this|strong=\"H2063\", let|strong=\"H3808\"everyone|strong=\"H3605\"who|strong=\"H3605\"is|strong=\"H3605\"godly|strong=\"H2623\"pray|strong=\"H6419\"to|strong=\"H5921\"you|strong=\"H3605\"in|strong=\"H5921\"a|strong=\"H3068\"time|strong=\"H6256\"when|strong=\"H6256\"you|strong=\"H3605\"may|strong=\"H4325\"be|strong=\"H3808\"found|strong=\"H4672\".  \nSurely|strong=\"H2063\"when|strong=\"H6256\"the|strong=\"H3605\"great|strong=\"H7227\"waters|strong=\"H4325\"overflow, they|strong=\"H3808\"shall|strong=\"H3808\"not|strong=\"H3808\"reach|strong=\"H5060\"to|strong=\"H5921\"him|strong=\"H5921\".   \n"},{"number":7,"text":"You are my|strong=\"H5341\"hiding|strong=\"H5643\"place|strong=\"H5643\".  \nYou will|strong=\"H6862\"preserve|strong=\"H5341\"me|strong=\"H5437\"from|strong=\"H5437\"trouble|strong=\"H6862\".  \nYou will|strong=\"H6862\"surround|strong=\"H5437\"me|strong=\"H5437\"with songs|strong=\"H7438\"of|strong=\"H5341\"deliverance|strong=\"H6405\". \\+w Selah|strong=\"H5542\"\\+w*."},{"number":8,"text":"I|strong=\"H5921\"will|strong=\"H5869\"instruct|strong=\"H3384\"you|strong=\"H5921\"and|strong=\"H3212\"teach|strong=\"H3384\"you|strong=\"H5921\"in|strong=\"H5921\"the|strong=\"H5921\"way|strong=\"H1870\"which|strong=\"H2098\"you|strong=\"H5921\"shall|strong=\"H5869\"go|strong=\"H3212\".  \nI|strong=\"H5921\"will|strong=\"H5869\"counsel|strong=\"H3289\"you|strong=\"H5921\"with|strong=\"H5921\"my|strong=\"H5921\"eye|strong=\"H5869\"on|strong=\"H5921\"you|strong=\"H5921\".   \n"},{"number":9,"text":"Don’t be|strong=\"H1961\"like|strong=\"H1961\"the|strong=\"H7126\"horse|strong=\"H5483\", or|strong=\"H5483\"like|strong=\"H1961\"the|strong=\"H7126\"mule|strong=\"H6505\", which|strong=\"H5483\"have|strong=\"H1961\"no|strong=\"H1077\"understanding,  \nwho are|strong=\"H5483\"controlled by|strong=\"H1961\"bit|strong=\"H4964\"and|strong=\"H5483\"bridle|strong=\"H7448\", or|strong=\"H5483\"else they|strong=\"H1077\"will|strong=\"H1961\"not|strong=\"H1077\"come|strong=\"H1961\"near|strong=\"H7126\"to|strong=\"H1961\"you|strong=\"H7126\".   \n"},{"number":10,"text":"Many|strong=\"H7227\"sorrows|strong=\"H4341\"come|strong=\"H5437\"to|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3068\"wicked|strong=\"H7563\",  \nbut|strong=\"H7563\"loving kindness|strong=\"H2617\"shall|strong=\"H3068\"surround|strong=\"H5437\"him|strong=\"H3068\"who|strong=\"H3068\"trusts in|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3068\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\".   \n"},{"number":11,"text":"Be|strong=\"H3068\"glad|strong=\"H8055\"in|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3605\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\", and|strong=\"H3068\"rejoice|strong=\"H8055\", you|strong=\"H3605\"righteous|strong=\"H6662\"!  \nShout|strong=\"H7442\"for|strong=\"H7442\"joy|strong=\"H7442\", all|strong=\"H3605\"you|strong=\"H3605\"who|strong=\"H3605\"are|strong=\"H3068\"upright|strong=\"H3477\"in|strong=\"H3068\"heart|strong=\"H3820\"!   \n"}]}
